    <p><strong>SCFPSSD</strong>: Manage Security Risk Inherent in the Use of Third-Party Components</p>
    <p><strong>SCSIC</strong>: Vendor Sourcing Integrity Controls, Peer Reviews and Security Testing</p>
    <p><strong>SCTPC</strong>: MAINTAIN, ASSESS</p>
    <p><strong>SP80053</strong>: SA-9, SR-3, SR-4, SR-4(3), SR-4(4)</p>
